@startuml
title Identity and document process — supplied foundation
actor User
participant Browser
participant "Identity Platform" as IDP
actor "Authorised operator" as Operator
participant "Domain API" as API
database "Domain PostgreSQL" as DB
collections "Quarantine GCS" as Q
participant "Scanner job" as Scan
collections "Clean GCS" as Clean
User -> Browser : Sign up / sign in
Browser -> IDP : SDK authentication (MFA for staff)
IDP --> Browser : Verified ID token
Operator -> IDP : Approve tenant/client/role claims
Operator -> IDP : Revoke old sessions; require new sign-in
Browser -> IDP : Sign in / obtain new token
Browser -> API : POST document metadata + token + idempotency key
API -> IDP : Verify token; check revocation/disabled account
API -> DB : Set transaction-local tenant/client/actor scope
API -> DB : Validate parent; create awaiting_upload + audit
DB --> API : Document UUID
API --> Browser : 201 metadata
Browser -> API : PUT raw bytes + token
API -> API : Enforce size, MIME, signature and SHA-256
API -> DB : Lock document; check ownership/state
API -> Q : Create-only object
Q --> API : Object generation
API -> DB : Commit quarantined + generation + audit
API --> Browser : 202 quarantined
Operator -> Scan : Run job with tenant/document UUIDs
Scan -> Q : Fetch exact generation
Scan -> Scan : Verify content + current AV definitions + scan
alt scan clean
 Scan -> Clean : Create-only clean object
 Clean --> Scan : Clean generation
 Scan -> DB : Commit clean status + pinned generation + audit
 Browser -> API : Authenticated download
 API -> DB : Authorise resource; require clean status
 API -> Clean : Fetch exact clean generation
 API --> Browser : Attachment bytes
else infected or scanner error
 Scan -> DB : Rejected if infected; leave quarantined on error
 Browser -> API : Download
 API --> Browser : 423 blocked
end
@enduml
